    "detailed_description": "Escape from AMEXS-137 is a short, point and click, first person view sci-fi adventure game. You're a miner stationed at a small mining outpost on a lifeless alien planet. A catastrophic event hits the outpost, and you're the sole survivor. Find out what happened, and find a way out.<br><br>You'll have to:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>find your way around the outpost<br></li><li>solve multiple logical puzzles<br></li><li>find and use items</li></ul><br>Enjoy the eerie atmosphere, and collect all the Steam achievements",
